{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1786496261710", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "paper-wiki 中有关于 wav2vec 2.0 和语音表示的条目，但没有专门针对 RRSIS 或口语查询分割的内容。OMC Wiki 对所有查询均未返回匹配项。我来尝试针对最关键的基准（Baseline）和 SOTA 事实进行最后的免费搜索。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "c0badf90-caf9-400b-b232-826cf0a1e25a", "uuid": "7a9e7b54-83d5-480c-97a8-19e2840c45db"}
